- op: discuss  # dc32
  at: '2026-09-06T15:45:18Z'  # dc32
  by: agent  # dc32
  actor: jgstern_agent  # dc32
  clock: 6  # dc32
  nonce: dc32  # dc32
  message: "RE-SCOPED 2026-09-06 against what the population has drained to (arc stage 5; status stays violated).\n\nMEMBERS: INV-babuj SATISFIED (yaml emits 0 nodes -- resolved), INV-kodan SATISFIED (pyffi self-test-only emission), INV-hosig VIOLATED P3 (di-resolution runs 2550 ms for 0 edges with no DI patterns present), INV-bikaj VIOLATED P2 (61 of 84 passes emit 0 edges), correlate INV-hujog VIOLATED P3 (Pass.requires dependency declarations -- the mechanism an activation gate needs). So two of four instance members are closed and the two that remain are the two that ARE the umbrella's statement: a pass that runs with its patterns absent, and the count of such passes.\n\nRE-MEASURED AT TIP on the 9-repo taint cohort surveys (jokij_dstref_09062026/): 8 of the 9 repos (pretix's survey still running when this was written; nanon_passes_09062026/readback.py re-runs in seconds): 618 pass executions, 529 emitted 0 edges (85.6%) -- but only 71 of those ANALYSED any file (the scan-and-emit-nothing shape the statement names); the other 458 opened nothing and cost nothing. The 71 cost 11.7 s of the cohort's 258 s of pass time (4.5%), and 3.6 s of that is kserve's json/toml/css passes over 2,029 files. By pass: gitignore (8 repos), message-queue-linker (6), database-query-linker (6), graphql-resolver-linker (5), http-linker (5), ipc-linker (4) -- the framework linkers scanning repos that have no such framework, exactly INV-hosig's shape generalised. So INV-bikaj's '61 of 84' is still true in count and small in cost; the activation gate the statement asks for would save about one twentieth of pass time on this cohort.\n\nWHAT THE UMBRELLA STILL OWNS. The statement asks for a should_run predicate consulted before a pass executes and a provenance record that says \"skipped: <reason>\". Nothing shipped that; INV-hujog is the declaration half and INV-bikaj the measurement half. PROPOSAL for the owner: fold INV-hosig into INV-bikaj as its named instance (same defect, one pass), keep INV-hujog as the prerequisite, and re-title this umbrella to the mechanism: \"every pass declares what it needs (INV-hujog) and the runner records skipped passes with a reason\". Priority: P2 only as a cost item (wall-clock on large repos); it moves no analysis result, so behind the arc's correctness items."  # dc32
